# merge.js contains four deliberate NUL characters, used as delimiters in the
# merge's tie-break keys. Git's own heuristic reads a NUL as "this is binary"
# and stops producing diffs. `diff` forces a textual diff regardless; `text`
# normalises line endings.
*.js   text diff
*.json text diff
*.html text diff
*.css  text diff
*.md   text diff
